    {
      "t": "2026-11-22T00:00:01Z",
      "text": "Israel's opposition leader Eisenkot condemned 'Jewish terrorism' after settler attacks on Palestinian villages in the West Bank.",
      "cites": [
        "news:dw:f4c08d0b63d1",
        "news:guardian:043841536d7c",
        "news:france24:0689dfc975ab"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-22T00:00:06Z",
      "text": "Al Jazeera reports that displaced Palestinians are protesting as Israeli air strikes continue in Gaza.",
      "cites": [
        "news:aljazeera:1a3cd6eb8d9b"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-22T00:00:11Z",
      "text": "DW, The Guardian and France 24 also reported the story.",
      "cites": [
        "news:dw:f4c08d0b63d1",
        "news:guardian:043841536d7c",
        "news:france24:0689dfc975ab"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-22T00:00:18Z",
      "text": "On 17 November, five Palestinians were killed, including a child, in a series of Israeli airstrikes on various areas of the Gaza Strip.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-17:1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-22T00:00:25Z",
      "text": "On 19 November, according to Gaza's health ministry, two people were killed by recent Israeli attacks and two others died from their wounds over the past day.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-19:7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-22T00:00:32Z",
      "text": "On 21 November, Gaza's civil defence agency reported four people killed by Israeli fire, three in a drone strike on a food-carrying vehicle in Gaza City and one by gunfire in Jabalia.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-21:1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-22T00:00:48Z",
      "text": "The Gaza Strip, also known simply as Gaza, is the smaller of the two Palestinian territories, the other being the West Bank.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1387149368:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-22T00:00:53Z",
      "text": "Together the two territories make up the State of Palestine in the Southern Levant region of West Asia.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1387149368:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-22T00:00:59Z",
      "text": "The Gaza Strip is located in the Southern Levant, and it was founded in 1949.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q39760:P276",
        "wd:Q39760:P571"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-22T00:01:18Z",
      "text": "Al Jazeera headlined its report 'Displaced Palestinians protest as Israeli air strikes continue in Gaza.'",
      "cites": [
        "news:aljazeera:1a3cd6eb8d9b"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-22T00:01:24Z",
      "text": "DW headlined its report 'Israel's Eisenkot condemns Jewish terrorism in West Bank.'",
      "cites": [
        "news:dw:f4c08d0b63d1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-22T00:01:30Z",
      "text": "The Guardian headlined its report 'Netanyahu rival condemns Jewish terrorism after settler attacks on Palestinian villages.'",
      "cites": [
        "news:guardian:043841536d7c"
      ]
    },
